; Bitmap address of the first pixel line of an attribute cell
;
; Converts an attribute address into the screen bitmap address of the top pixel line of the same cell: only the high
; byte changes, from $58-$5A to $40, $48 or $50.
; .
; Hardware: knows the layout of the screen bitmap and the attribute file.
;
; HL Attribute address
; O:HL Bitmap address of the top line of the cell
@label=AttrToBitmap
c$A203 LD A,H        ;
 $A204 AND $03       ;
 $A206 ADD A,A       ;
 $A207 ADD A,A       ;
 $A208 ADD A,A       ;
@isub=OR SCREEN_HIGH
 $A209 OR $40        ;
 $A20B LD H,A        ;
 $A20C RET           ;
